{
    "title": "Aquarium Land - Fishbowl World",
    "description": "Welcome to Aquarium Land, one of the most relaxing sea world fish game you'll ever play!! If you enjoy fishing games and simulation games, then you're at the right place!\r\n\r\nAre you a good scuba diver? Do you enjoy simulation games? Have you ever had a curiosity for aquariums and fishbowls? Diving for fish is Fun! Go fish in the sea, catch big and tiny fish species like goldfish, starfish, pink dolphin, shark, koi fish, crawfish and add them in your fish tank to expand your aquarium mini mart and attract more visitors and buyers to your fish io market! Use your scuba diver simulation games fishbrain to enter the fishdom sea, find the best fish spots for fishing in your favorite fishing games!\r\n\r\nDiscover new mystery while diving in the simulation games ocean and fish things in your fishing game, you can collect them too in your fishbowl, there is a customer for every sea & ocean animal, big fish or tiny fish , pink dolphin or pink whale. All you have to do is fish with attitude & enjoy selling fish to get money like a proper tycoon!\r\n\r\nInvest in your Aquarium Land - Fishbowl World mini mart and explore the sea & ocean world like in real fishy tycoon games! The more money you earn, the more upgrades you can get! This fish game is fun and addicting just like my mini mart, circle the fish and tiny fishing, but rich with fishes like goldfish, starfish and many other sea animals living the fishdom fish life of a simulation games tycoon!\r\n\r\nCan you find the right fishing spots to catch more fish and fill your fish tank even when the tides are high? Use your scuba diver fishbrain, think like them and play by fish rules to fill your fisbowl aquarium!\r\n\r\nTo be the tycoon of simulation games, fishing games and all the sea you need to think like a mini mart owner, fish all the rare species and make the most appealing aquarium of the world! Shark mindset? No! Simulation games tycoon mindset!\r\n\r\nGo fish in the ocean, enter the simulation games sea and unlock new fish tanks in you tiny fishing fishbowl aquarium! Fish games will never be so fun if you fish with attitude! Bring your level of finding fishing spots to expert, circle the fish and collect it! This is not a tiny fishing game, you have to put en effort in every fish you bring to the fishbowl you will catch and fish with attitude!\r\n\r\nYour visitors want more beautiful aquarium fishbowl fishes like goldfish, starfish, and more tiny fish species, and you are the one that should get them in your simulator games fishbowl aquarium and fish tank, swim carefully like a tycoon even when the tides are high, and directly sell fish in your simulation games mini mart! \r\n\r\nSelling more gives more money to expand your aquarium fishbowl! Act like in real fish tycoon games in this tanked aquarium game and use the money from the fishes to buy more aquariums for the simulation games sea world fishdom. Fishing games rule, mini mart tycoon simulation games rules!!\r\n\r\nCan you be the top fishbowl tycoon, let the tides lead your mini mart and rule your tile aquarium? Sounds fishy?!  Don't worry! This is how simulation games work!\r\n\r\nPlay Aquarium Land, enter the aquarium of simulation games now, and fill your fishbowl, go fishing!",
